,"sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:19170","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:19170","name":"KAZUHIKO AZUMA","detail":"エグゼクティブプロデューサー、アートディレクター","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-creator:119880","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"KGM","creatorId":"egs:creator:19171","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:19171","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:19171","name":"KGM","detail":"制作補佐","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-creator:119881","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"守屋謙一郎","creatorId":"egs:creator:19172","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:19172","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:19172","name":"守屋謙一郎","detail":"グラフィックデザイナー","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"alias-only-review","relationId":"egs:work-creator:119882","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"たかなまい","creatorId":"egs:creator:18710","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:18710","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:18710","name":"たかなまい","detail":"CGアシスタント","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-creator:121066","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"犬・よしき","creatorId":"vndb:s5235","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5235","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5235","name":"犬・よしき","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:4510","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"松崎 健一","creatorId":"vndb:s11961","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11961","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11961","name":"松崎 健一","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:4513","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c14801","characterName":"大隈 レイジ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c14801"},"originalCharacterName":"大隈 レイジ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Captain Osumi Leiji is a special investigator assigned by Military Intelligence to resolve the suspected sabotage taking place on Moon Base D-02. His cover on the base is \"Technical Consultant\". He has been given limitless command authority over Elise Triad in order to assist him with his assignment."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Leiji previously used to be a fighter pilot, but was shot down and subsequently tortured by an old first generation android. Because of his traumas, he isn't comfortable with the need to work closely with Elise. She might be a third generation android, but he still views her as nothing but a robot. As he wrestles with his own conflicting emotions, he must struggle to remain focused on the task at hand. One wrong judgement could not only endanger his comrades, but also result in his death as well as the death of millions on planet Earth."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Game's Manual"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c14801"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3b/3befa0e480bd4666f704e569d687aa623702f93b33e4c6662b475964aa6ed295.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bd/bdd5dfd0035bb5d41e131d5d81011bb5a584f3c1dfff280fef8c70b5359012f8.webp","width":250,"height":250,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c14802","characterName":"篠塚 レイコ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c14802"},"originalCharacterName":"篠塚 レイコ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Corporal Reiko Shinozuka is Leiji's official support liaison. Due to her clumsiness and lack of communication skills, Reiko's extraordinary intelligence at working with computers has been overlooked by everyone. Of course, that means she's a potential suspect for the damage of the base's computer system. She takes an immediate liking to Leiji due to their common Japanese ancestry."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Game's Manual and Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c14802"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0b/0bc4e8b6f906a339bbbf085030e113a4703c5b998c7bcc7678ff91db694c0b32.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bb/bb6385e489696abd67086251d9bb993614b4c1cbe49cd14f03fb78a0c0c06bf7.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"木村 真理子","creatorId":"vndb:s8509","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8509","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8509","name":"木村 真理子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:1499","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c14803","characterName":"エリス・トライアド","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c14803"},"originalCharacterName":"エリス・トライアド","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An engineering support specialist and a top-secret military android prototype EL-03, Elise is undergoing on-site testing on a remote moon base. Her true identity and nature is known only by Captain Osumi Leiji and Commander Carla Benedict. To everybody else on the base, she's just an ordinary, low level technical staff member. Her skills will prove to be invaluable for Leiji's investigation. Despite her humanesque qualities, in the beginning Leiji will only see her as nothing but a mechanical doll."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Game's Manual and Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c14803"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c3/c35c3ae22d2102bc18a20a55c20cdff7424294196806ce33346ecafd0a7fb8c5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c0/c0f225554214d1f537de4217d3eae034b67d1770471ff7adda99c2e2df59d7da.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"西野 ありす","creatorId":"vndb:s8510","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8510","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8510","name":"西野 ありす","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:1500","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c14804","characterName":"カーラ・ベネディクト","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c14804"},"originalCharacterName":"カーラ・ベネディクト","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lt. Colonel Carla Benedict is a former millitary commando and a commander of the moon base. Having both technical and commando background, she's perfectly suited to be in charge of all base operations. She keeps her military background secret,"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"as well as her former marriage and subsequent divorce"},{"spoiler":false,"text":". Her vast knowledge and power as well as her position also makes her a suspect in possible sabotage of base's operations so Captain Leiji has to keep his true identity secret even from her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Game's Manual and Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c14804"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3e/3ef91fefda389ee8aaa61674ef6a52e964bc499e25acd71918a00a41bdf7107a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ed/ed3a2b4fbcf2aa9a70d518afe3936fa446c0233f4ef3df48c1f01b5674ce5edc.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"山田 夜詩子","creatorId":"vndb:s7044","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7044","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7044","name":"山田 夜詩子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:1498","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c14805","characterName":"モニカ・ブラウン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c14805"},"originalCharacterName":"モニカ・ブラウン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Monica is a civilian reporter who works for a major broadcast network that somehow managed to get a clearance to record from inside the moon base, despite the fact that most of the activity there is highly classified. She has a dual personality. Monica is aggressive and vulgar while wearing the goggles for her 3-D camera, and on the opposite - shy and unsure without them. Even with her limited access to the facilities as a civilian, few people would seriously consider her to be capable of sabotage. But Captain Leiji will keep an eye on her nevertheless."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Game's Manual and Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c14805"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dd/dd22d17de2a41ddb992c189537f54f88bc2ae4b07f13f9cc65f0d9364c6ef7d5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ec/ecb714e5fafc46c94de6aae87a97f6aaf353981d9e264ba38eca569262dec0bf.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"梅田 桃","creatorId":"vndb:s21286","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s21286","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s21286","name":"梅田 桃","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:1501","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c14806","characterName":"黄麗","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c14806"},"originalCharacterName":"黄麗","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Captain Lai Wong, the commanding officer of the technical portion of the base where the sabotage is occuring and next in command after Commander Carla Benedict, is an extremely haughty person and she is proud of her Chinese heritage. She also has a superiority complex and hates being overshadowed by anyone for any reason. Being a difficult person to deal with doesn't make her an automatic suspect, but her complete knowledge of the base operations means she mustn't be overlooked by Captain Leiji."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Game's Manual and Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c14806"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b9/b904b22740bb9effd996a6b8e7f3c6471c66f80c046700f18934599902bd22e5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1e/1e9ccc7dc6235a217a6c68f1ef1b92034f0287e65953003d990d0491165275c2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"白井 綾乃","creatorId":"vndb:s665","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s665","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s665","name":"あらい しずか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:1496","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c14807","characterName":"マレッタ・ディアス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c14807"},"originalCharacterName":"マレッタ・ディアス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lieutenant Maretta Dias is an engineering technical specialist. She is also Lai Wong's right-hand girl. Despite her innocuously pretty looks, she is quite competent. Maretta makes sure that Lai Wong's orders are followed to the letter and without question."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Game's Manual"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c14807"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/73/739f7cef34cc748fa3c50a49a3ca864e54e0f1eb5cf0973e4a922f91d676876a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9e/9eb614042e65a037a33219a9031abbe98221a70742fffa93de45a2e719340f43.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"山吹 ことり","creatorId":"vndb:s7043","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7043","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7043","name":"山吹 ことり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:1497","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c14808","characterName":"ジュリエッタ・ソーンダイク","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c14808"},"originalCharacterName":"ジュリエッタ・ソーンダイク","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"2nd Lieutenant Julietta Thorndike is the Commando Squad Leader on the moon base. She was trained by Sergeant Jackie Kaminski at the Military Academy. She is physically competent and keeps the commando squad on the base in top shape. While the model of physical fitness, she's really ignorant when it comes to technical matters. This makes it virtually impossible for her to be the saboteur on the base but nobody will be written off as suspicious by Captain Leiji."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Game's Manual and Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c14808"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/86/8694603f93c7dc52b48b68b66ca9b09caa52ff4dfec524b5f4eb841057dc9771.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3d/3d4f356116222af6d1268fba8d7e79b4c76dff3a5809fb0f5591ce68e2bcc484.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"茉莉奈","creatorId":"vndb:s58","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s58","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s58","name":"雪絵 れな","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:1495","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c14809","characterName":"ジャッキー・カミンスキー","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c14809"},"originalCharacterName":"ジャッキー・カミンスキー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of the few men on the base, Sergeant Jackie Kaminski is the top Non-Commissioned Officer (NCO). He respects brute force over anything else. The ultimate professional, he has the respect of everyone. However, he has a reputation for not getting \"involved\" with other troops, even though others currently have no self-control in that area. He was Julietta's drill sergeant at the Military Academy and she often relies on his judgement even though she is technically his superior."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Game's Manual and Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c14809"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9d/9d0942d2ebb8170a7e152e7b71bba11c7fa711b2228d9fe9dd704cd82694e7c4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7e/7e5b63a4b5def6945f56a8055381c45adcfd0b8a169637465656fc766333edc5.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c56514","characterName":"クリスティン・ラッセル","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c56514"},"originalCharacterName":"クリスティン・ラッセル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kristin is a technician working in the Engineering section of the Moon Base D-02. Along with Sergeant Jackie Kaminski he is one of the few men on the base. Ever since the sabotage of the base's operations had begun, he couldn't do his job properly so he seeks the assistance of the \"Technical Advisor\". He hopes that the new guy will be able to restore the base's functionality to its full capacity."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c56514"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cd/cdf28d6dae51bde5671853a5698675f036909ec706ffeb8e79ed82e7efbb8eb1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/03/03186dc45ed6b53d3409ee083cb14afd64c2a46e17aebb372e7d3b3ef2f7a93d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p865","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:141","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p865","name":"Sweet Basil","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","re